   "sentenceId": 12,
   "he": "רַבָּן גַּמְלִיאֵל אוֹמֵר: כְּשֵׁם כּוּ׳. תַּנְיָא, אָמַר לָהֶן רַבָּן גַּמְלִיאֵל לַחֲכָמִים: סוֹפְרִים, הַנִּיחוּ לִי וְאֶדְרְשֶׁנָּה כְּמִין חוֹמֶר.",
   "en": "The mishna states that «Rabban Gamliel says: Just as» her actions were the actions of an animal, so too, her offering is animal food. «It is taught» in a baraita that «Rabban Gamliel said to the Sages: Scribes, permit me, and I will explain it as a type of decorative wreath [ḥomer],» i.e., an allegory."
  }
 ],
